         "text": "LXR drum machine for Ableton Move (RNBO Move Takeover).\nGenerated by rnbo/tools/patch.py - edit the sources in rnbo/src and run rnbo/tools/build.py and rnbo/tools/patch.py again.\nMove input/LED drivers: Cycling '74 rnbo.move.templates, MIT license (rnbo/patchers/vendor).",
